{%- comment -%}
  Website merchandising from the DH & DCO console: cross-sells under the add-to-bag form, upgrades,
  and the store's pop-up, exactly as published in Stock & buying → Website merch.

  Install once, in layout/theme.liquid just before </body>:
    {% render 'dh-merch', store_id: 'labesny-web', console: 'https://ops.example.com' %}

  store_id is the storefront's channel id (see README.md). To choose where the row sits on the
  product page, put <div data-dh-merch></div> in the product section; without it, the row goes
  after the add-to-bag form. Nothing else in the theme changes when a placement is published.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if store_id != blank and console != blank -%}
  <script
    src="{{ console }}/merch/embed.js"
    data-store="{{ store_id }}"
    {% if template contains 'product' %}data-product="{{ product.handle }}"{% endif %}
    defer
  ></script>
{%- endif -%}
